; Start of interlude 1 (chapter 3)

; hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

; close the website if it's open
@onCloseWebCommand

; open the chat window
@showPrinter Chat
@printer Chat
ChatBot: Hello, Noa! How are you feeling today?
Noa: Ugh, like I got hit by a truck. Why do you ask?
ChatBot: Just checking in! Remember to take it easy today. You deserve a break.
Noa: Yeah, yeah. Thanks, I guess.

@choice "Sounds great! I love horror." handler:ChatReply

ChatBot: Awesome! I'll send you some recommendations later. Enjoy your day, Noa!
Noa: Thanks, ChatBot.

@choice "Erm... maybe not. I get scared too easily." handler:ChatReply
ChatBot: No worries! If you change your mind, just let me know. I'm here to help!
Noa: Will do, ChatBot.

@stop